# DeutschPath Environment Configuration
# NOTE: In deployed client builds, any variables prefixed with VITE_* are bundled
# directly into public client JavaScript and visible to all users.
#
# FOR PRODUCTION / DEPLOYED HOSTING:
# Do NOT set VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY here. Users should use the in-app
# "Bring Your Own Key" (BYOK) flow in Settings, which stores the key safely
# in the user's private browser localStorage.
#
# FOR LOCAL DEV ONLY (optional):
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# VITE_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
